     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><div>Lucas, you just want to put <br><br>\\include{diff_slum}<br><br></div>in the appropriate place in your main doc. Knitr will respect the raw latex command. But you have to strip the <br><br>\\documentclass[]{article}<br>\\setlength{\\pdfpagewidth}{8.5in} \\setlength{\\pdfpageheight}{11in}<br>\\begin{document}<br><br></div>and <br><br>\\end{document}<br><br></div>from your included file.<br><div><br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br clear=\"all\"><div><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(53,28,117)\"><br><br>___________________________</span><span style=\"color:rgb(53,28,117)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(53,28,117)\">___________</span>__________</span><br></div><div><a href=\"http://www.promente.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.promente.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792355180507000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Epby0aUbm7Ayo0RY044vG\">www.promente.org</a> <span style=\"color:rgb(7,55,99)\"><br></span></div></div><span style=\"color:rgb(7,55,99)\">skype: stevepowell99<br></span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(7,55,99)\">mobile: <a href=\"tel:+387%2061%20215%20997\" value=\"+38761215997\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+387 61 215 997</a></span><br></div></div></div>\r\n<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
