nd-repeat:initial\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.8048000335693px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.8048000335693px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><br></p></font></span></div></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
