   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Thanks Steve, <div><br></div><div>your suggestion works. But having to edit the latex file for each table introduces a major manual step in the process. </div><div><br></div><div>Perhaps I could use R to read the .tex file, delete the first two and the last rows and save as .tex again?</div><div><br></div><div>Is there a more &quot;naitive&quot; markdown way of doing t his?</div><div><br></div><div>regards</div><div>Lucas </div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
